# A denylist: the build needs the lockfile, the package sources and docker/.
# Patterns start with **/ so they match in every folder, not only the root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
.superpowers
.vscode
corpus
packages/*/test
sbom.json
**/widedoor-report
**/widedoor-review
**/evidence
**/.widedoor
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Secrets never enter the build context.
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.keystore
**/*storageState*.json
**/.auth
